{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05272","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六龙齐轸御朝曦，双鷁维舟下绿池。\n飞观仰看云外耸，浮桥直见海中移。\n灵泉巧凿天孙渚，孝笋能抽帝女枝。\n幸愿一生同草树，年年岁岁乐於斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}